		;ぱんつはいてません
		IF EQUIP:下半身下着２ == 0 && EQUIP:下半身下着１ == 0
			;膣内精液1000以上
			IF EX:TARGET:14 > 1000
				;周りに人がいて見られてる
				IF GET_TARGETNUM() == 1 && !DATE_HITOGOMI(CFLAG:PLAYER:現在位置) && !WITH_MOB()
					;露出癖の高い変態てゐ
					; IF ABL:露出癖 > 3 ;repetition
					; PRINTFORML 「Ahhn... %CALLNAME:MASTER%...%UNICODE(0x2764)% Nhiii%UNICODE(0x2764)% Wh-What do you need...?%UNICODE(0x2764)%」
					; PRINTFORMDL As you approach and call out to Tewi, you notice a waterfall of gloopy, cloudy fluid dribbling between her legs from under her one-piece.
					; PRINTFORMDL Her feet are already slathered with semen, leaving a trail of white puddles behind her...
					; PRINTFORMDL Nearby onlookers have clearly noticed Tewi's debauchery, and avert their gazes while muttering "pervert" under their breaths...
					; ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「아흠... %CALLNAME:MASTER%...%UNICODE(0x2764)% 니이%UNICODE(0x2764)% 뭐 필요한 거 있어...?」
					PRINTFORMDL 당신이 테오이에게 다가가 부르자, 그녀의 원피스 아래에서 걸쳐 흐르는 걸쭉하고 구름 같은 액체가 눈에 들어온다.
